<title>USA: Bucyrus Int'l names Smoke as CFO.</title>
<headline>Bucyrus Int'l names Smoke as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bucyrus International Inc said on Tuesday that it named Daniel Smoke as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Until August, James Annand served as interim CFO.</p>
<p>Smoke has held similar positions with Folger Adam Co and Eagle Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Bucyrus manufacvtures surface mining equipment.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
